  m_text: 'This is a Pac-Man level generator, where by using the player''s preferences,
    new levels can be made that suit their interests.


    Starting with randomly
    generated levels, the user will continue playing, with the moments used between
    levels acting as a way to collect information on preferences.


    You will
    play until prompted to exit the study, at which point the proctor will ask questions
    about your experience.


    You may press Start when you are ready.'
